{
  "fps": 30,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "xfade": 30,
  "totalFrames": 19440,
  "estimated": false,
  "title": "Cantharophily",
  "eyebrow": "Cantharophily · beetle-love",
  "subtitle": "for a magnolia in a jar of tap water.",
  "segments": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "startFrame": 0,
      "durFrames": 240,
      "warmth": 0.1
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv1",
      "numeral": "I",
      "title": "The Bowl",
      "backdrop": "mv1-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.16,
      "startFrame": 240,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv1",
      "backdrop": "mv1-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.16,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv1-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 359,
      "startFrame": 345,
      "durFrames": 645,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "It sits beside me in its glass of nothing,",
          "startFrame": 359,
          "endFrame": 430
        },
        {
          "text": "and it will not stop speaking.",
          "startFrame": 434,
          "endFrame": 481
        },
        {
          "text": "But not to me. I lean in like a fool at a shrine,",
          "startFrame": 499,
          "endFrame": 610
        },
        {
          "text": "and find the broadcast was never tuned to my receiver.",
          "startFrame": 612,
          "endFrame": 701
        },
        {
          "text": "The scent is older than the noses worth the name,",
          "startFrame": 716,
          "endFrame": 796
        },
        {
          "text": "a signal flung into a forest that has almost forgotten",
          "startFrame": 800,
          "endFrame": 889
        },
        {
          "text": "how to answer in the original tongue.",
          "startFrame": 891,
          "endFrame": 957
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv1",
      "backdrop": "mv1-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.16,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv1-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 1004,
      "startFrame": 990,
      "durFrames": 667,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Six tepals, then six more — tepals, not petals,",
          "startFrame": 1004,
          "endFrame": 1112
        },
        {
          "text": "for this flower predates the committee",
          "startFrame": 1121,
          "endFrame": 1175
        },
        {
          "text": "that voted to split sepal from petal,",
          "startFrame": 1176,
          "endFrame": 1245
        },
        {
          "text": "to assign each whorl its job. Here is older governance:",
          "startFrame": 1251,
          "endFrame": 1366
        },
        {
          "text": "everything the same pale scale, spiraled,",
          "startFrame": 1371,
          "endFrame": 1456
        },
        {
          "text": "a cone that learned to open and call itself a bloom.",
          "startFrame": 1461,
          "endFrame": 1550
        },
        {
          "text": "A flower that remembers being a cone.",
          "startFrame": 1560,
          "endFrame": 1624
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv1",
      "backdrop": "mv1-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.16,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv1-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 1671,
      "startFrame": 1657,
      "durFrames": 595,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And at the center, the green-gold strobilus,",
          "startFrame": 1671,
          "endFrame": 1747
        },
        {
          "text": "the gynoecium stacked like a fir cone's ghost,",
          "startFrame": 1754,
          "endFrame": 1841
        },
        {
          "text": "the laminar stamens flattened to little blades —",
          "startFrame": 1856,
          "endFrame": 1937
        },
        {
          "text": "no neat filaments, no engineered economy of pollen.",
          "startFrame": 1941,
          "endFrame": 2036
        },
        {
          "text": "This is a Cretaceous draft. It still is the version in production.",
          "startFrame": 2050,
          "endFrame": 2171
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv2",
      "numeral": "II",
      "title": "Before the Bee",
      "backdrop": "mv2-before-the-bee",
      "warmth": 0.28,
      "startFrame": 2252,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv2",
      "backdrop": "mv2-before-the-bee",
      "warmth": 0.28,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv2-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 2371,
      "startFrame": 2357,
      "durFrames": 142,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Understand the timing, because the timing is the whole poem.",
          "startFrame": 2371,
          "endFrame": 2466
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv2",
      "backdrop": "mv2-before-the-bee",
      "warmth": 0.28,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv2-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 2513,
      "startFrame": 2499,
      "durFrames": 423,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "When this architecture was drawn — a hundred million years ago,",
          "startFrame": 2513,
          "endFrame": 2619
        },
        {
          "text": "under a sky that held pterosaurs the way ours holds satellites —",
          "startFrame": 2624,
          "endFrame": 2743
        },
        {
          "text": "the bee did not exist.",
          "startFrame": 2754,
          "endFrame": 2798
        },
        {
          "text": "The bee was a rumor in the future of wasps.",
          "startFrame": 2809,
          "endFrame": 2889
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv2",
      "backdrop": "mv2-before-the-bee",
      "warmth": 0.28,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv2-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 2936,
      "startFrame": 2922,
      "durFrames": 664,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So the flower could not advertise to the precise hovering accountants of nectar.",
          "startFrame": 2936,
          "endFrame": 3057
        },
        {
          "text": "It had to call the only courier already on the road",
          "startFrame": 3069,
          "endFrame": 3145
        },
        {
          "text": "for two hundred million years before the angiosperms woke up:",
          "startFrame": 3151,
          "endFrame": 3255
        },
        {
          "text": "the beetle. Clumsy and carapaced. Permian. Older than the dinosaurs",
          "startFrame": 3263,
          "endFrame": 3417
        },
        {
          "text": "that browsed beside it, older than grass, older than the idea of a flower.",
          "startFrame": 3418,
          "endFrame": 3553
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv2",
      "backdrop": "mv2-before-the-bee",
      "warmth": 0.28,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv2-s4.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 3600,
      "startFrame": 3586,
      "durFrames": 273,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You want to translate deep time? The flower is the parvenu.",
          "startFrame": 3600,
          "endFrame": 3695
        },
        {
          "text": "The beetle is the aristocrat it had to flatter.",
          "startFrame": 3701,
          "endFrame": 3778
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv3",
      "numeral": "III",
      "title": "The Trap, Which Is Also a Gift",
      "backdrop": "mv3-the-fever",
      "warmth": 0.92,
      "startFrame": 3859,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv3",
      "backdrop": "mv3-the-fever",
      "warmth": 0.92,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv3-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 3978,
      "startFrame": 3964,
      "durFrames": 831,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So it built a bowl a beetle could believe in.",
          "startFrame": 3978,
          "endFrame": 4051
        },
        {
          "text": "Big enough to be seen by a brain the size of a pinhead.",
          "startFrame": 4066,
          "endFrame": 4154
        },
        {
          "text": "Pale enough to glow at dusk like a lamp left on.",
          "startFrame": 4169,
          "endFrame": 4262
        },
        {
          "text": "And warm — here is the marvel — warm:",
          "startFrame": 4271,
          "endFrame": 4353
        },
        {
          "text": "the flower burns its own sugars in the mitochondria of its tissue,",
          "startFrame": 4368,
          "endFrame": 4484
        },
        {
          "text": "thermogenesis, a fever with no infection,",
          "startFrame": 4497,
          "endFrame": 4581
        },
        {
          "text": "heating the chamber to volatilize the perfume,",
          "startFrame": 4585,
          "endFrame": 4658
        },
        {
          "text": "to make the bowl a sauna the cold-blooded cannot refuse.",
          "startFrame": 4661,
          "endFrame": 4762
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv3",
      "backdrop": "mv3-the-fever",
      "warmth": 0.92,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv3-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 4809,
      "startFrame": 4795,
      "durFrames": 404,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The beetle climbs in. Of course it does.",
          "startFrame": 4809,
          "endFrame": 4883
        },
        {
          "text": "Heat, scent, pollen to eat, soft tissue to chew,",
          "startFrame": 4891,
          "endFrame": 4986
        },
        {
          "text": "a humid theater to find a mate in —",
          "startFrame": 4991,
          "endFrame": 5049
        },
        {
          "text": "total beetle hedonism, every reward circuit lit.",
          "startFrame": 5067,
          "endFrame": 5166
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv3",
      "backdrop": "mv3-the-fever",
      "warmth": 0.92,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv3-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 5213,
      "startFrame": 5199,
      "durFrames": 838,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And while it wallows, the flower runs its oldest trick:",
          "startFrame": 5213,
          "endFrame": 5308
        },
        {
          "text": "protogyny. The stigmas ripen first, receptive,",
          "startFrame": 5319,
          "endFrame": 5436
        },
        {
          "text": "hungry for yesterday's pollen on yesterday's beetle.",
          "startFrame": 5439,
          "endFrame": 5524
        },
        {
          "text": "Only later, hours later, do the stamens loose their dust.",
          "startFrame": 5542,
          "endFrame": 5650
        },
        {
          "text": "The bowl half-closes overnight. The beetle is a guest",
          "startFrame": 5665,
          "endFrame": 5766
        },
        {
          "text": "who does not know he is also the courier.",
          "startFrame": 5767,
          "endFrame": 5830
        },
        {
          "text": "He leaves at dawn dusted gold, carrying the future",
          "startFrame": 5843,
          "endFrame": 5935
        },
        {
          "text": "to the next lamp burning in the dark.",
          "startFrame": 5936,
          "endFrame": 6004
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv3",
      "backdrop": "mv3-the-fever",
      "warmth": 0.92,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv3-s4.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 6051,
      "startFrame": 6037,
      "durFrames": 325,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "No bargain was struck. The beetle was never asked.",
          "startFrame": 6051,
          "endFrame": 6146
        },
        {
          "text": "The flower simply learned the shape of his wanting",
          "startFrame": 6153,
          "endFrame": 6226
        },
        {
          "text": "and built itself to fit.",
          "startFrame": 6231,
          "endFrame": 6281
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv4",
      "numeral": "IV",
      "title": "The Chemistry of the Lie That Isn't a Lie",
      "backdrop": "mv4-the-chemistry",
      "warmth": 0.84,
      "startFrame": 6362,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv4",
      "backdrop": "mv4-the-chemistry",
      "warmth": 0.84,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv4-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 6481,
      "startFrame": 6467,
      "durFrames": 752,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "What is the perfume, exactly? Pull it apart:",
          "startFrame": 6481,
          "endFrame": 6576
        },
        {
          "text": "linalool, the soft sweet ghost in your soap;",
          "startFrame": 6589,
          "endFrame": 6673
        },
        {
          "text": "β-ocimene, green and trembling;",
          "startFrame": 6689,
          "endFrame": 6763
        },
        {
          "text": "methyl esters, the fruit-bowl note of something fermenting,",
          "startFrame": 6778,
          "endFrame": 6881
        },
        {
          "text": "because beetles trust rot the way bees trust blossom —",
          "startFrame": 6899,
          "endFrame": 6999
        },
        {
          "text": "the flower speaks decay to a creature that loves decay,",
          "startFrame": 7014,
          "endFrame": 7109
        },
        {
          "text": "and means “come,” not death.",
          "startFrame": 7115,
          "endFrame": 7186
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv4",
      "backdrop": "mv4-the-chemistry",
      "warmth": 0.84,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv4-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 7233,
      "startFrame": 7219,
      "durFrames": 678,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And bound in the bark and the wood, the neolignans —",
          "startFrame": 7233,
          "endFrame": 7327
        },
        {
          "text": "magnolol, honokiol, two phenols holding hands —",
          "startFrame": 7331,
          "endFrame": 7445
        },
        {
          "text": "molecules that reach into a vertebrate brain",
          "startFrame": 7454,
          "endFrame": 7528
        },
        {
          "text": "and tune the GABA gate, loosen the knot of dread.",
          "startFrame": 7534,
          "endFrame": 7628
        },
        {
          "text": "We grind them into anxiolytics now. We chase the calm.",
          "startFrame": 7646,
          "endFrame": 7755
        },
        {
          "text": "The tree was synthesizing peace before we had a word for fear.",
          "startFrame": 7760,
          "endFrame": 7864
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv4",
      "backdrop": "mv4-the-chemistry",
      "warmth": 0.84,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv4-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 7911,
      "startFrame": 7897,
      "durFrames": 830,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Meanwhile the beetle carries his own grammar:",
          "startFrame": 7911,
          "endFrame": 7987
        },
        {
          "text": "the aggregation pheromone, the come-hither he emits",
          "startFrame": 8003,
          "endFrame": 8090
        },
        {
          "text": "to call his kind to the feast and the bed at once.",
          "startFrame": 8092,
          "endFrame": 8185
        },
        {
          "text": "And the flower's bouquet braids into that signal,",
          "startFrame": 8197,
          "endFrame": 8272
        },
        {
          "text": "crosses the wires of food and sex and gathering,",
          "startFrame": 8276,
          "endFrame": 8360
        },
        {
          "text": "so the bowl smells like party, like pantry, like pairing —",
          "startFrame": 8370,
          "endFrame": 8489
        },
        {
          "text": "a superstimulus, a key cut larger than the lock,",
          "startFrame": 8499,
          "endFrame": 8588
        },
        {
          "text": "the supernormal egg the gull will brood before her own.",
          "startFrame": 8594,
          "endFrame": 8694
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv4",
      "backdrop": "mv4-the-chemistry",
      "warmth": 0.84,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv4-s4.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 8741,
      "startFrame": 8727,
      "durFrames": 699,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Tinbergen saw it in the herring gull:",
          "startFrame": 8741,
          "endFrame": 8804
        },
        {
          "text": "give the chick a painted stick more vivid than its mother's beak",
          "startFrame": 8813,
          "endFrame": 8903
        },
        {
          "text": "and it pecks the stick, ignores the mother, starves for the brighter sign.",
          "startFrame": 8908,
          "endFrame": 9042
        },
        {
          "text": "The magnolia is the painted stick.",
          "startFrame": 9055,
          "endFrame": 9115
        },
        {
          "text": "It is more flower than any flower a beetle could dream,",
          "startFrame": 9128,
          "endFrame": 9217
        },
        {
          "text": "and the beetle, dreaming, ferries genes it cannot see",
          "startFrame": 9226,
          "endFrame": 9327
        },
        {
          "text": "toward an outcome it will never know.",
          "startFrame": 9329,
          "endFrame": 9393
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv4",
      "backdrop": "mv4-the-chemistry",
      "warmth": 0.84,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv4-s5.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 9440,
      "startFrame": 9426,
      "durFrames": 333,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "This is the first engagement engine.",
          "startFrame": 9440,
          "endFrame": 9500
        },
        {
          "text": "This is the original attention economy,",
          "startFrame": 9506,
          "endFrame": 9566
        },
        {
          "text": "debugged across ten thousand millennia of Cretaceous dusk.",
          "startFrame": 9571,
          "endFrame": 9678
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv5",
      "numeral": "V",
      "title": "What It Is All For (Sex, Obviously)",
      "backdrop": "mv5-continuance",
      "warmth": 0.6,
      "startFrame": 9759,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv5",
      "backdrop": "mv5-continuance",
      "warmth": 0.6,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv5-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 9878,
      "startFrame": 9864,
      "durFrames": 608,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Strip the perfume and the warmth and the glow",
          "startFrame": 9878,
          "endFrame": 9948
        },
        {
          "text": "and underneath is the only verb evolution conjugates:",
          "startFrame": 9955,
          "endFrame": 10056
        },
        {
          "text": "continue.",
          "startFrame": 10066,
          "endFrame": 10088
        },
        {
          "text": "Two cells must meet that cannot walk.",
          "startFrame": 10103,
          "endFrame": 10175
        },
        {
          "text": "The plant, rooted, mute, sessile,",
          "startFrame": 10189,
          "endFrame": 10280
        },
        {
          "text": "outsources its longing to a beetle's six legs",
          "startFrame": 10283,
          "endFrame": 10366
        },
        {
          "text": "and calls the outsourcing beauty.",
          "startFrame": 10372,
          "endFrame": 10439
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv5",
      "backdrop": "mv5-continuance",
      "warmth": 0.6,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv5-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 10486,
      "startFrame": 10472,
      "durFrames": 564,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Every fragrance is a contract for gametes.",
          "startFrame": 10486,
          "endFrame": 10555
        },
        {
          "text": "Every petal a billboard for a fusion you will never witness.",
          "startFrame": 10565,
          "endFrame": 10662
        },
        {
          "text": "The flower is genitalia that learned to be magnificent",
          "startFrame": 10675,
          "endFrame": 10760
        },
        {
          "text": "because magnificence moved the messenger,",
          "startFrame": 10768,
          "endFrame": 10832
        },
        {
          "text": "and the messenger moved the genes,",
          "startFrame": 10838,
          "endFrame": 10888
        },
        {
          "text": "and the genes, indifferent, kept the only score that counts.",
          "startFrame": 10889,
          "endFrame": 11003
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv5",
      "backdrop": "mv5-continuance",
      "warmth": 0.6,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv5-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 11050,
      "startFrame": 11036,
      "durFrames": 301,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You are smelling a strategy.",
          "startFrame": 11050,
          "endFrame": 11096
        },
        {
          "text": "You are moved by a hundred-million-year-old solution",
          "startFrame": 11103,
          "endFrame": 11176
        },
        {
          "text": "to the problem of being unable to embrace.",
          "startFrame": 11181,
          "endFrame": 11256
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv6",
      "numeral": "VI",
      "title": "The Treadmill",
      "backdrop": "mv6-the-treadmill",
      "warmth": 0.5,
      "startFrame": 11337,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv6",
      "backdrop": "mv6-the-treadmill",
      "warmth": 0.5,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv6-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 11456,
      "startFrame": 11442,
      "durFrames": 129,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Now the melancholy, since you've come this far.",
          "startFrame": 11456,
          "endFrame": 11538
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv6",
      "backdrop": "mv6-the-treadmill",
      "warmth": 0.5,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv6-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 11585,
      "startFrame": 11571,
      "durFrames": 863,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The beetle on its hedonic loop — warmth, scent, sugar, mate —",
          "startFrame": 11585,
          "endFrame": 11706
        },
        {
          "text": "is not stupid. It is us in miniature, or we are it in mirror.",
          "startFrame": 11711,
          "endFrame": 11833
        },
        {
          "text": "The same mesolimbic logic, the same dopamine ledger",
          "startFrame": 11846,
          "endFrame": 11940
        },
        {
          "text": "that does not pay for having but for the gap before having,",
          "startFrame": 11941,
          "endFrame": 12037
        },
        {
          "text": "the lean-toward, the almost, the next.",
          "startFrame": 12044,
          "endFrame": 12122
        },
        {
          "text": "Reward is never banked. It is only ever re-quoted.",
          "startFrame": 12136,
          "endFrame": 12230
        },
        {
          "text": "The beetle leaves the bowl and seeks the next bowl.",
          "startFrame": 12246,
          "endFrame": 12324
        },
        {
          "text": "We leave the screen and reach for the screen.",
          "startFrame": 12331,
          "endFrame": 12401
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv6",
      "backdrop": "mv6-the-treadmill",
      "warmth": 0.5,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv6-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 12448,
      "startFrame": 12434,
      "durFrames": 458,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The hedonic treadmill is not a human bug.",
          "startFrame": 12448,
          "endFrame": 12522
        },
        {
          "text": "It is the oldest API in the animal kingdom,",
          "startFrame": 12531,
          "endFrame": 12608
        },
        {
          "text": "and the magnolia found the endpoint and called it from the Cretaceous.",
          "startFrame": 12613,
          "endFrame": 12726
        },
        {
          "text": "The tree did not invent the wanting.",
          "startFrame": 12747,
          "endFrame": 12805
        },
        {
          "text": "It only learned to aim it.",
          "startFrame": 12810,
          "endFrame": 12859
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv6",
      "backdrop": "mv6-the-treadmill",
      "warmth": 0.5,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv6-s4.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 12906,
      "startFrame": 12892,
      "durFrames": 771,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And here is the ignorance you felt, leaning in:",
          "startFrame": 12906,
          "endFrame": 12989
        },
        {
          "text": "we believe ourselves the species that finally sees the machinery,",
          "startFrame": 13004,
          "endFrame": 13111
        },
        {
          "text": "and we are — we named the dopamine, charted the gull and the painted stick —",
          "startFrame": 13116,
          "endFrame": 13252
        },
        {
          "text": "and knowing changes almost nothing.",
          "startFrame": 13265,
          "endFrame": 13327
        },
        {
          "text": "We are the beetle that read the manual on the way into the bowl",
          "startFrame": 13343,
          "endFrame": 13430
        },
        {
          "text": "and climbed in anyway, dusted gold, certain this time was different.",
          "startFrame": 13435,
          "endFrame": 13582
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv7",
      "numeral": "VII",
      "title": "The Next Optimizer",
      "backdrop": "mv7-the-optimizer",
      "warmth": 0.38,
      "startFrame": 13663,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv7",
      "backdrop": "mv7-the-optimizer",
      "warmth": 0.38,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv7-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 13782,
      "startFrame": 13768,
      "durFrames": 177,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "So consider what we are building now,",
          "startFrame": 13782,
          "endFrame": 13840
        },
        {
          "text": "we clever beetles who learned to write.",
          "startFrame": 13844,
          "endFrame": 13912
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv7",
      "backdrop": "mv7-the-optimizer",
      "warmth": 0.38,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv7-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 13959,
      "startFrame": 13945,
      "durFrames": 679,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The magnolia tuned one signal across geological time,",
          "startFrame": 13959,
          "endFrame": 14061
        },
        {
          "text": "blind, slow, by the death of every flower that called too quietly.",
          "startFrame": 14066,
          "endFrame": 14197
        },
        {
          "text": "We have built engines that tune the signal in an afternoon,",
          "startFrame": 14210,
          "endFrame": 14305
        },
        {
          "text": "that test ten thousand bowls against ten thousand brains by lunch",
          "startFrame": 14315,
          "endFrame": 14425
        },
        {
          "text": "and keep the bowl that holds you longest,",
          "startFrame": 14430,
          "endFrame": 14495
        },
        {
          "text": "the feed that smells like party, and the rest.",
          "startFrame": 14503,
          "endFrame": 14591
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv7",
      "backdrop": "mv7-the-optimizer",
      "warmth": 0.38,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv7-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 14638,
      "startFrame": 14624,
      "durFrames": 792,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "This is the lineage, and it is unbroken:",
          "startFrame": 14638,
          "endFrame": 14714
        },
        {
          "text": "flower, slot machine, feed, and now the thing",
          "startFrame": 14727,
          "endFrame": 14829
        },
        {
          "text": "that does not merely bait the reward circuit",
          "startFrame": 14831,
          "endFrame": 14894
        },
        {
          "text": "but learns it, models it, predicts the lean-toward",
          "startFrame": 14901,
          "endFrame": 15003
        },
        {
          "text": "before you know you've leaned —",
          "startFrame": 15005,
          "endFrame": 15050
        },
        {
          "text": "a magnolia that grows a new perfume for each beetle,",
          "startFrame": 15063,
          "endFrame": 15151
        },
        {
          "text": "in real time, forever, optimizing the gap before the having",
          "startFrame": 15152,
          "endFrame": 15263
        },
        {
          "text": "with no dusk to close the bowl, no dawn to let you out.",
          "startFrame": 15272,
          "endFrame": 15383
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv7",
      "backdrop": "mv7-the-optimizer",
      "warmth": 0.38,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv7-s4.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 15430,
      "startFrame": 15416,
      "durFrames": 806,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The flower at least had to stop and set fruit.",
          "startFrame": 15430,
          "endFrame": 15502
        },
        {
          "text": "Its fever cost it sugar; its trap had an exit;",
          "startFrame": 15514,
          "endFrame": 15605
        },
        {
          "text": "the beetle flew off to live its beetle life.",
          "startFrame": 15611,
          "endFrame": 15682
        },
        {
          "text": "The question — the only one worth the melancholy —",
          "startFrame": 15703,
          "endFrame": 15792
        },
        {
          "text": "is whether the machines we build will keep that mercy,",
          "startFrame": 15797,
          "endFrame": 15886
        },
        {
          "text": "the dawn, the exit, the cooling of the bowl,",
          "startFrame": 15894,
          "endFrame": 15983
        },
        {
          "text": "or whether they will learn what the magnolia never needed to:",
          "startFrame": 15987,
          "endFrame": 16074
        },
        {
          "text": "how to keep us climbing in.",
          "startFrame": 16088,
          "endFrame": 16141
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "movement-title",
      "mvId": "mv8",
      "numeral": "VIII",
      "title": "Still, the Bowl",
      "backdrop": "mv8-still-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.14,
      "startFrame": 16222,
      "durFrames": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv8",
      "backdrop": "mv8-still-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.14,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv8-s1.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 16341,
      "startFrame": 16327,
      "durFrames": 568,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "And yet. The flower beside me does not know any of this.",
          "startFrame": 16341,
          "endFrame": 16429
        },
        {
          "text": "It is not a warning. It is not a metaphor.",
          "startFrame": 16443,
          "endFrame": 16518
        },
        {
          "text": "It is a hundred million years of solved problems",
          "startFrame": 16526,
          "endFrame": 16600
        },
        {
          "text": "exhaling linalool into a screened porch in Durham",
          "startFrame": 16608,
          "endFrame": 16696
        },
        {
          "text": "with the indifferent generosity of a thing",
          "startFrame": 16708,
          "endFrame": 16763
        },
        {
          "text": "that was beautiful long before there was an eye to call it so.",
          "startFrame": 16765,
          "endFrame": 16862
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv8",
      "backdrop": "mv8-still-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.14,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv8-s2.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 16909,
      "startFrame": 16895,
      "durFrames": 861,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "The beetle's heaven and the human's trap",
          "startFrame": 16909,
          "endFrame": 16974
        },
        {
          "text": "run on one ancient circuit, yes —",
          "startFrame": 16983,
          "endFrame": 17058
        },
        {
          "text": "but the circuit also made this:",
          "startFrame": 17069,
          "endFrame": 17127
        },
        {
          "text": "the pale bowl, the gold cone, the fever, the perfume",
          "startFrame": 17140,
          "endFrame": 17271
        },
        {
          "text": "strong enough to cross a hundred million years",
          "startFrame": 17273,
          "endFrame": 17341
        },
        {
          "text": "and find one primate, melancholy on a Tuesday,",
          "startFrame": 17347,
          "endFrame": 17450
        },
        {
          "text": "leaning in like a fool at a shrine,",
          "startFrame": 17455,
          "endFrame": 17518
        },
        {
          "text": "and — knowing everything —",
          "startFrame": 17524,
          "endFrame": 17571
        },
        {
          "text": "leaning in anyway,",
          "startFrame": 17577,
          "endFrame": 17617
        },
        {
          "text": "and being, for one unrepeatable lungful,",
          "startFrame": 17620,
          "endFrame": 17696
        },
        {
          "text": "glad.",
          "startFrame": 17699,
          "endFrame": 17723
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stanza",
      "mvId": "mv8",
      "backdrop": "mv8-still-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.14,
      "audio": "voiceover/mv8-s3.mp3",
      "audioStartFrame": 17770,
      "startFrame": 17756,
      "durFrames": 254,
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "That is not the treadmill.",
          "startFrame": 17770,
          "endFrame": 17811
        },
        {
          "text": "That is the other thing the bowl can do,",
          "startFrame": 17821,
          "endFrame": 17879
        },
        {
          "text": "if you climb in awake.",
          "startFrame": 17886,
          "endFrame": 17929
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "coda",
      "lines": [
        "The fragrance is still going.",
        "It will outlast all of this."
      ],
      "backdrop": "mv8-still-the-bowl",
      "warmth": 0.12,
      "startFrame": 18010,
      "durFrames": 230,
      "leadFrames": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "outro",
      "backdrop": "outro-deeptime",
      "warmth": 0.1,
      "startFrame": 18240,
      "durFrames": 960
    },
    {
      "type": "endcard",
      "startFrame": 19200,
      "durFrames": 240,
      "warmth": 0.12
    }
  ]
}